  "lines": {
    "hook": "Ten nominees for the Kopa Trophy. Here's how EA FC 27 rates them, and what they actually did last season.",
    "items": [
      "Kerim Alajbegović. Seventy-one. Thirteen goals, four assists.",
      "Lennart Karl. Seventy-seven. He missed the World Cup injured.",
      "Ibrahim Maza, eighty. Four World Cup starts.",
      "Johan Manzambi, eighty. Three goals at the World Cup.",
      "Eli Junior Kroupi, eighty. Thirteen Premier League goals.",
      "Ayyoub Bouaddi, eighty. A World Cup quarter-final.",
      "Warren Zaïre-Emery, eighty-three. A Champions League winner.",
      "Yan Diomande, eighty-four. Thirteen goals, nine assists.",
      "Pau Cubarsí, eighty-six. Every minute of a World Cup win.",
      "And the game's number one: Lamine Yamal. Ninety. Twenty-four goals, seventeen assists."
    ],
    "quote": "Yamal will probably win the Kopa. Cubarsí has already won the World Cup's version of it.",
    "ballot": "Our ballot: five points to Cubarsí, three to Yamal, one to Diomande.",
    "close": "The winner is announced on the twenty-sixth of October. The full read is on scoutgamer.com."
  },
